{"author": "careerwithvasanth", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000002", "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000003", "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000004"], "form": "rhetorical_move", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "once these three things are set, nobody can trick you in the interview because you know the concept so well.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000004"}], "text": "Vasanth emphasizes the importance of understanding concepts deeply by using terms like 'trick you in the interview' and 'know the concept so well.'"}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Importance of concept understanding", "topic": "study methods"}, "content_hash": "e344b73fd2438299416e511aea0e33438e76b5379be90b1d5138b5cd765259b1", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:expression:f8f4b72e7919d6d1", "metadata_hash": "80de6a9fc71e04e70294db03ae496a0c4864721574ccf735d1fd93f4c265ca67", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2025-01-03", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7eed79355bd51b176dbede9688b1d5f665aa031f69e7ed469a3b51f70d9d2114", "source_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BfDVA_OsFLM", "title": "Importance of concept understanding", "topic": "study methods", "topic_slug": "study-methods"}
{"author": "careerwithvasanth", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000005"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "First thing to study is fundamentals of JavaScript. Because without fundamentals of JavaScript, whether you pick React, Angular, Vue or any other framework, Node.js or any other framework, you're not gonna master it.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000005"}], "text": "Vasanth uses a structured explanation to convey the necessity of JavaScript fundamentals, stating what to study first and why it's critical."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "JavaScript fundamentals advice", "topic": "frontend development"}, "content_hash": "e344b73fd2438299416e511aea0e33438e76b5379be90b1d5138b5cd765259b1", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:expression:93befe8883403d82", "metadata_hash": "80de6a9fc71e04e70294db03ae496a0c4864721574ccf735d1fd93f4c265ca67", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2025-01-03", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7eed79355bd51b176dbede9688b1d5f665aa031f69e7ed469a3b51f70d9d2114", "source_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BfDVA_OsFLM", "title": "JavaScript fundamentals advice", "topic": "frontend development", "topic_slug": "frontend-development"}
{"author": "careerwithvasanth", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000007", "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000008"], "form": "rhetorical_move", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "just from the job point of view, I don't see there is lot of opportunities in Angular or Vue.js compared to React.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000007"}], "text": "Vasanth contrasts React with Angular and Vue.js based on job opportunities, advising to choose React for more job prospects."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Contrast of frameworks based on job opportunities", "topic": "frontend development"}, "content_hash": "e344b73fd2438299416e511aea0e33438e76b5379be90b1d5138b5cd765259b1", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:expression:3da1fcb3a5128149", "metadata_hash": "80de6a9fc71e04e70294db03ae496a0c4864721574ccf735d1fd93f4c265ca67", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2025-01-03", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7eed79355bd51b176dbede9688b1d5f665aa031f69e7ed469a3b51f70d9d2114", "source_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BfDVA_OsFLM", "title": "Contrast of frameworks based on job opportunities", "topic": "frontend development", "topic_slug": "frontend-development"}
{"author": "careerwithvasanth", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000013", "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000014"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Building a strong portfolio.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000013"}, {"quote": "I've divided portfolio into two parts. One is basic portfolio, another one is a advanced portfolio.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:u000014"}], "text": "The advice is structured into two sections: basic and advanced portfolio, with explanations of what each should contain."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Portfolio advice", "topic": "career advice"}, "content_hash": "e344b73fd2438299416e511aea0e33438e76b5379be90b1d5138b5cd765259b1", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2:expression:8e11a1a773775cb6", "metadata_hash": "80de6a9fc71e04e70294db03ae496a0c4864721574ccf735d1fd93f4c265ca67", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2025-01-03", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7eed79355bd51b176dbede9688b1d5f665aa031f69e7ed469a3b51f70d9d2114", "source_id": "youtube-video-2025-01-03-master-frontend-development-in-2025-a-complete-roadmap-bfdva-7c1566cce2", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BfDVA_OsFLM", "title": "Portfolio advice", "topic": "career advice", "topic_slug": "career-advice"}
